							</span></div><!-- Body --><div
					id="card_details_page_14371_body"
					class="card-body vstack gap-1 p-2"
					style="height: 270px;"
				><!-- Title --><h3
								id="card_details_page_14371_body_title"
								class="flex-shrink-0 mb-0 fs-5"
							><a
									href="/14371/"
